    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are thrilled to present this beautiful bright and spacious two-bedroom apartment located in the highly sought after Westend Gate development right in the heart of Tallaght. The development is always in high demand as it is within easy reach of all local amenities including shopping facilities such as the Square Shopping Centre, a variety of bars & restaurants, an extensive choice of sports grounds & leisure facilities, and a great mix of primary & secondary schools. The area is well serviced with excellent bus routes and road networks and The Red Luas Line is within mere minutes' walk.\r\n \r\nBright, airy and most spacious internal living accommodation of c. 70 sqm briefly comprises of entrance hall with two separate storage rooms, large open plan living/dining area, fully fitted kitchen, two double bedrooms with built in wardrobes (one master ensuite) and main family bathroom. This apartment has the benefit of a large balcony which can be accessed from all rooms. \r\nNo. 65 comes to the market in good condition throughout it comes as a blank canvas with no onward chain with plenty of additional features such as fitted wardrobes in both bedrooms, spacious balcony and double-glazed windows to name but a few. There is designated underground parking with a working lift inside the development also. \r\n\r\nDue to size and location, we see this property being extremely popular amongst a wide range of buyers such as first-time buyers looking to get onto the property ladder, investors looking to capitalise on the strong rents in the area or anyone looking to downsize and have all amenities on your doorstep so contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today for further information or to arrange a viewing! \r\n\r\nAdditional Features; \r\nBER B\r\nC. 70 sqm\r\nDesignated underground parking space\r\nManagement fee c. 2,000 per annum\r\n2 Bed / 2 Bath\r\nLocated on the second floor\r\nExtra spacious apartment\r\nBlank canvas \r\nNo onward chain \r\nEntrance hallway with two storage rooms\r\nLarge open plan living/dining area\r\nFully fitted kitchen \r\nTwo generous bedrooms\r\nOne master ensuite\r\nBuilt in wardrobes\r\nMain family bathroom \r\nSunny balcony \r\nAccess from all rooms to balcony \r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nElectric heating\r\nAmple storage space\r\nBright and spacious\r\nWithin arm's reach of N7 and M50 Motorway\r\nHighly sought-after development\r\nPrime for first time buyers, investors and downsizers alike!\r\n\r\nDirections If travelling on N81 towards Tallaght, pass the Square Shopping Centre on the right-hand side. At the next traffic light junction, with The Maldron Hotel to your left, Westend Gate is to your right. Make your way into the block and no. 65 is on the second floor."
      },
      {
